  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "計算機程式語言",
    "sub_ename": "COMPUTER PROGRAMMING LANGUAGE",
    "describe_ch": "這門課程的主要目的在於使學生具備基本的計算機程式語言撰寫能力，同時鼓勵學生使用計算機程式語言作為輔助工具，以有效提升其專業知能的學習；現今，計算機程式語言具有簡便的互動式使用者環境，而其所具備之強大數值計算能力和圖形視覺功能，使其被廣泛應用於許多科學研究領域範疇中。在此一課程，學生將學習計算機程式語言的基本概念諸如:變數宣告、輸入/輸出、迴圈、邏輯條件、陣列、函數及使用者介面操作等內容。",
    "describe_eh": "The primary objective of this course is to teach students the fundamental concepts of computer programming skill as well as encourage them to use computer programming language as a tool to improve professional learning. Modern computer programming language has been broadly used in a variety of scientific research areas. It provides an easy-to-use interactive environment which includes extensive numerical computation and visualization capabilities. In this course, the basic programming concepts include variables, input/output, loops, conditionals, arrays, functions, and graphical user interfaces.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
